      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Higginsport%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "White burley tobacco first grew near Higginsport in 1864, and by the 1880s the village shipped about 2 million pounds annually down the Ohio River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23,
        24,
